        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1165 Adjustable Offset Commercial Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis commercial offset door pull is designed so you can fit it to your existing  door holes. It has a 12\" maximum CTC (Center to Center) mounting holes. Easy to disassemble and cut to fit you existing door holes. Great for any office or store front doors. It can be surface mounted or thru bolted the with included hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<B>Adjustable Mounting Holes:</b> For doors with existing holes less 12\" CTC,  simply remove the cast aluminum end mounting brackets and cut the handle to the desired length. Reinstall the end mounting bracket and screw it to your door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1165-door-pull.jpg?v=1704354557\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1165 adjustable Door Pull size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 1165 Adjustable Offset Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Offset from Mounting Point: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center (CTC): 12\" Maximum</li>\r\n<li>Total Pull Length, Maximum: 14.830\"</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: (2) each 1/4-20 x 2\" flat head machine screws, (2) each 1/4-20 x 3/4\" flat head machine screws,  (2) each trim washers and (2) each 1/4-20 x 1\" sex nuts.</li>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1165.pdf?v=1704262430\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1165 Offset Door Pull Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- \r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle).</i>\r\n</p>",
